/S /P
/P 59 0 R
/E (After the death of this girl that is revealed to be a friend of lain, lain looks up her phone and sees messages from her friend, which says that she isn't dead but alive without a body, on the internet. Nowadays we see a lot of people just living on the internet, without going out. This was such a terrifying prediction of the future, which sadly is getting worse. This anime gets really uneasy when you realize that many things came true, and that is such a masterpiece. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
